{"id":"5f5604bfa28fe2ea","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-relation-symbol.md","title":"Relation Symbol","display":"df-relation-symbol — Relation Symbol","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-relation-symbol","aliases":["57-df-relation-symbol"],"display":"df-relation-symbol — Relation Symbol","depends_on":["[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-arity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-relation-symbol"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-relation-symbol</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relation-symbol — Relation Symbol"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b55affe36ee4719a\" href=\"?note=b55affe36ee4719a\" title=\"57-df-arity\">57-df-arity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in S\">\\(R\\in S\\)</span>；符号分量及元数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b55affe36ee4719a\" href=\"?note=b55affe36ee4719a\" title=\"57-df-arity\">57-df-arity</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelationSymbol}\">\\(\\mathrm{RelationSymbol}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<